      en: "The Cultural House in Zalău (Casa de Cultură) is a multipurpose venue. Opened in 1972, it exemplifies socialist-era modern architecture. The building includes a 600-seat hall, a library, and rehearsal rooms. It hosts various cultural associations. The facade features simple vertical lines. Renovated after 1990, it holds concerts, theatre, and exhibitions. Located in the city center.",
